{"unit_id":"TYEclipse__dsh-musictheory#feature-note-math","repo":"TYEclipse/dsh-musictheory","commit":"3d4e3c2179ebf47f3880d35ad03055da0391ed16","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-musictheory 的「音符换算」功能：解析带升降号的音名，返回 MIDI、音级、频率和等音拼写；也可由频率反查最近音符。通过 note_info 或 freq_to_note 工具调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:332-425"]}
{"unit_id":"TYEclipse__dsh-musictheory#feature-chords-scales","repo":"TYEclipse/dsh-musictheory","commit":"3d4e3c2179ebf47f3880d35ad03055da0391ed16","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-musictheory 的「和弦与音阶」功能：按根音和类型构建正确拼写的和弦或音阶，并返回音符、级数及音程。通过 chord_build 或 scale_generate 工具调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:427-523"]}
{"unit_id":"TYEclipse__dsh-musictheory#feature-intervals-transpose","repo":"TYEclipse/dsh-musictheory","commit":"3d4e3c2179ebf47f3880d35ad03055da0391ed16","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-musictheory 的「音程与移调」功能：构建指定方向的目标音、识别两音音程，或按音程移调一组音并保留正确拼写。通过 interval_build、interval_info 或 transpose 调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:524-623","src/tools.ts:690-773"]}
{"unit_id":"TYEclipse__dsh-musictheory#feature-identify","repo":"TYEclipse/dsh-musictheory","commit":"3d4e3c2179ebf47f3880d35ad03055da0391ed16","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-musictheory 的「和弦与音阶识别」功能：输入演奏音符集合，返回匹配候选，可标示转位或缺音。分别通过 chord_identify 和 scale_identify 调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:774-927"]}
{"unit_id":"TYEclipse__dsh-musictheory#feature-harmony","repo":"TYEclipse/dsh-musictheory","commit":"3d4e3c2179ebf47f3880d35ad03055da0391ed16","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-musictheory 的「调性分析」功能：查询调号及关系调，计算音阶和弦，或把和弦进行标注为罗马数字与转位。通过 key_signature、scale_harmonize 或 roman_numeral 调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:624-689","src/tools.ts:928-1087"]}
